# ROS2_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md Sec 7.2. Requires state HOLDING; ends in
# AT_PLACE on success, gripper still closed (or ERROR on failure). Fails
# fast (before moving) if so_arm_100_kinematics reports the target
# unreachable either way round (Sec 9.6's base/tip flip-retry).
#
# approach_from_above is accepted but NOT YET IMPLEMENTED as a distinct
# approach+insert cartesian path (Sec 7.2 steps 3-4) -- this phase reuses
# Phase 3's hardware-proven single joint-move place. Reserved for a
# follow-up; passing true today has no effect.

so_arm_100_stick_msgs/StickSpec target
bool approach_from_above
---
bool success
string message
---
string step
uint8 step_index
uint8 step_count
